     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;white-space:pre-wrap\">We are happy to announce several improvements to the </span><a href=\"http://www.rstudio.com/products/shinyapps/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.rstudio.com/products/shinyapps/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363742520000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2RFhHD4_LXuFEnu7xj2qRv\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;text-decoration:underline;white-space:pre-wrap\">shinyapps.io</span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial;white-space:pre-wrap\"> platform. </span></p><br><ul style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-family:Arial;vertical-align:baseline;margin-left:15px\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><a href=\"https://support.rstudio.com/hc/en-us/articles/204536558-Enabling-use-of-private-packages-on-github-com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://support.rstudio.com/hc/en-us/articles/204536558-Enabling-use-of-private-packages-on-github-com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363742521000&amp;usg=AOvVaw27cekwDowyyqVX5KqAk8t8\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Using private packages on github.com</span></a><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> -- for customers who have developed their own proprietary private R packages, you can now use those packages in the shiny applications you deploy to </span><a href=\"http://www.rstudio.com/products/shinyapps/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.rstudio.com/products/shinyapps/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363742521000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3RdKgDaKBiOwzMYKFC13j5\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;white-space:pre-wrap\">shinyapps.io</span></a><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> </span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-family:Arial;vertical-align:baseline;margin-left:15px\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><a href=\"https://support.rstudio.com/hc/en-us/articles/204536588-Downloading-your-application-from-shinyapps-io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://support.rstudio.com/hc/en-us/articles/204536588-Downloading-your-application-from-shinyapps-io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363742521000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1TqKtMbpTQkzdeNiY7Wn-4\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Download your application</span></a><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> -- Have you ever misplaced your application on your local machine?  You can now download the version of your app that is running on </span><a href=\"http://www.rstudio.com/products/shinyapps/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.rstudio.com/products/shinyapps/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363742521000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3RdKgDaKBiOwzMYKFC13j5\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;white-space:pre-wrap\">shinyapps.io</span></a><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">.  </span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-family:Arial;vertical-align:baseline;margin-left:15px\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Finally we made a few tweaks to the dashboard and invoices to give you better visibility into your billing cycle information, and to make it a bit easier for you to expense your subscription internally.</span></p></li></ul><div><span><br></span></div>As always, please don&#39;t hesitate to send us your feedback.  </span><div><span><br></span></div><div><span>Best,</span></div><div><span><br><span style=\"font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">The <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363742521000&amp;usg=AOvVaw10HZ5CUvi2-lMeVdni0QqK\">shinyapps.io</a> team</span></span><br></div></div>"
